    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a shooting game where you blow away a futon with a rocket launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player set out on a journey with his partner Rocket Launcher to clean the Futon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is a cleaning spot 1km away. No matter what, don't drop the futon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*&quot;Futon ga Futtonda&quot;,&quot;Blow up the Futon&quot; is a famous Japanese pun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Shoot the futon with the rocket launcher and it will fly away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.If you shoot the futon in the air, you can make it fly even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Repeat this to make the futon fly farther.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.If you drop the futon on the ground, the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game consists of multiple levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a story mode where you aim for the futon cleaning spot 1km away, and a challenge mode where you aim to fly the futon farther.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to pick up the rocket launcher ammo that is falling on the ground as you move along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that appear along the way will attack the futon and try to make it fall to the ground, so use the rocket launcher to fight them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy a moderate amount of thrill as you have to fight and collect ammunition while being careful not to drop the futon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rankings will be released after clearing the game. You can compete with players from all over the world to see how far the futon flies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a shooting game where you blow away a futon with a rocket launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player set out on a journey with his partner Rocket Launcher to clean the Futon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is a cleaning spot 1km away. No matter what, don't drop the futon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*&quot;Futon ga Futtonda&quot;,&quot;Blow up the Futon&quot; is a famous Japanese pun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game rules</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.Shoot the futon with the rocket launcher and it will fly away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.If you shoot the futon in the air, you can make it fly even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.Repeat this to make the futon fly farther.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.If you drop the futon on the ground, the game is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game consists of multiple levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a story mode where you aim for the futon cleaning spot 1km away, and a challenge mode where you aim to fly the futon farther.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to pick up the rocket launcher ammo that is falling on the ground as you move along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that appear along the way will attack the futon and try to make it fall to the ground, so use the rocket launcher to fight them off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy a moderate amount of thrill as you have to fight and collect ammunition while being careful not to drop the futon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rankings will be released after clearing the game. You can compete with players from all over the world to see how far the futon flies.</p>",
    "short_description": "Blow away the futon with a rocket launcher! Fly it far, you win.",
